    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35348" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεικονίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>impart form to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἀμόρφους ὕλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					1.10.1
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Med.
			, <i>have portrayed in</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἑαυτοῦ [λόγους] τοῖς ἑτέρων
					ἐνεικονίζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.40d
				</span></i>
			; <i>represent as by an image,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				1355.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θεῶν κάλλος δι᾽ ἐγκοσμίων εἰδῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					23p.468M.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				152
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>find a place in a metaphor</i> or <i>piece of
				symbolism,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				pp.480,503
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i></div>
